{
  "uid": "rednexus-slo",
  "title": "RedNexus · SLO y operación",
  "tags": [
    "rednexus",
    "slo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**SLO de RedNexus:** el **95 %** de las solicitudes de ayuda recibe candidatos en **menos de 30 segundos**, medido desde que se crea la solicitud hasta que el worker guarda el top 3 (métrica `rednexus.match.latency`). Elige el periodo arriba a la derecha (por defecto, 24 horas)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "SLI: solicitudes con candidatos en < 30 s",
      "description": "Fracción de solicitudes del periodo que recibieron candidatos en menos de 30 s. Objetivo: 95 %.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.95
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(rednexus_match_latency_seconds_bucket{le=~\"30(.0)?\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(rednexus_match_latency_seconds_count[$__range]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Presupuesto de error restante",
      "description": "100 % = ninguna solicitud lenta; 0 % = se gastó todo el 5 % permitido.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "1 - ((1 - (sum(increase(rednexus_match_latency_seconds_bucket{le=~\"30(.0)?\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(rednexus_match_latency_seconds_count[$__range])))) / (1 - 0.95))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
